    "preface": "<p>First action, if <code>.scripts/aw-gate.js</code> exists: <code>node .scripts/aw-gate.js track aw-check-workflow-compliance</code> (silent no-op otherwise).</p>\n<p>Review workflow-policy evidence for scoped local changes before publication. This audit does not require a push, upstream branch, or remote access. This is an accountability check, not a security sandbox, and it does not replace CI or <code>aw-review</code>.</p>\n",
